 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 2.5,
   "text": "You can't fix your sleep at night, you fix it in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": 3.0,
   "e": 6.48,
   "text": "There's one number that fixes most bad nights, and it isn't your bedtime."
  },
  {
   "s": 6.88,
   "e": 11.28,
   "text": "Say you wake up at 7 all week, then sleep in until 10 on the weekend. That's 3 hours."
  },
  {
   "s": 11.8,
   "e": 15.58,
   "text": "By Monday your body clock is in a different time zone, so you lie awake at midnight and"
  },
  {
   "s": 15.58,
   "e": 20.32,
   "text": "drag yourself out of bed. The number is your wake-up time. Pick one you can keep 7 days a week,"
  },
  {
   "s": 20.7,
   "e": 25.66,
   "text": "weekends 2, say 7.30. Step 2. When the alarm goes off, get daylight within 10 minutes."
  },
  {
   "s": 25.66,
   "e": 28.4,
   "text": "Open the curtains or have your coffee by the window."
  },
  {
   "s": 28.84,
   "e": 34.9,
   "text": "Step 3. Work backwards. If you need 8 hours, bedtime is 11.30, so set a second alarm at 11"
  },
  {
   "s": 34.9,
   "e": 40.58,
   "text": "to start winding down. But what about Saturday? You don't have to be strict, sleep in 1 hour max,"
  },
  {
   "s": 40.86,
   "e": 46.94,
   "text": "8.30 not 10. Keep that for a week and the jagged line goes flat. Monday stops feeling like jet"
  },
  {
   "s": 46.94,
   "e": 51.8,
   "text": "lag and most nights you get sleepy around the same time. Here's your reset, same wake time,"
  },
  {
   "s": 51.8,
   "e": 57.06,
   "text": "7 days, daylight within 10 minutes, a wind-down alarm before bed, send this to the friend who"
  },
  {
   "s": 57.06,
   "e": 62.46,
   "text": "sleeps until noon on Sundays. That's what Demure is for. You archive your dream today so you can"
  },
  {
   "s": 62.46,
   "e": 67.18,
   "text": "see it tomorrow and break it down into small steps you can actually do. And follow because"
  },
  {
   "s": 67.18,
   "e": 72.3,
   "text": "tomorrow's reel is what to do the morning after a bad night. If you want to try it out, I've put"
  },
  {
   "s": 72.3,
   "e": 73.18,
   "text": "the link in the bio."
  }
 ],
 "wps": 3.57
}